```php
foreach ($container->getDefinitions() as $id => $definition) {
    if ($definition->isPublic()) {
        $connectedIds[$id] = true;
        $this->processValue($definition);
    }
}
```

Wait — `AbstractRecursivePass::processValue(Definition)` → what does this traverse? Arguments + **method calls**? Let me look at AbstractRecursivePass::processValue's handling of Definition:

